{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubetory</strong> is a factory-building game with a pure automation focus. Place mining drills, conveyor belts, launchers, stampers, power stations, and tons of other machines as you build your factory.<br><strong><br>Space is limited</strong>, and <strong>resource patches are unique</strong>. Each new paint/ore patch you encounter will have to be used efficiently to meet the production requirements to unlock the next upgrades.\u00a0As you progress, you'll grow your island, unlock new technologies, and uncover new resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>no enemies or time limits</strong>, you'll have all the time you need to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/banner_gif_1.gif?t=1749218632\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Paint-based manufacturing with the P.I.T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything you produce in <strong>Cubetory</strong> is a cube, and all cubes end up in the <strong>PIT</strong>. Early game, that means mining cubes and painting them a specific pattern. Complexity quickly ramps up from there with assembly chains, byproducts, non-deterministic processes, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/banner_gif_2.gif?t=1749218632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3027060?t=1749218632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/c9c0cf8e4cab44998f34a7ff2819e4db0a0d0bb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749218632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/c4dc6c535c2dccce22ef5b1a8b61bc01003ea053/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749218632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka